@k.words.au.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Au pos=noun n=1 gloss="a soft yellow malleable ductile (trivalent and univalent) metallic element; occurs mainly as nuggets in rocks and alluvial deposits; does not react with most chemicals but is attacked by chlorine and aqua regia" synonym=gold synonym="atomic number 79" is_a="noble metal" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
